.DS_Store
__pycache__/
# art/ is the local workspace: the artist's images, extracted original-game references,
# 3D models and render frames. Too big for git, and partly not ours to publish. The game
# assets made from it live in Content/.
art/*
!art/inbox/
!art/masters/
art/inbox/*
art/masters/*
!art/inbox/.gitkeep
!art/masters/.gitkeep
